1
00:00:00,528 --> 00:00:02,788
(Penny:)Sheldon, what did you say?

2
00:00:02,997 --> 00:00:05,987
The truth. You don't wanna live
with Leonard and you know it.

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,500
- Since when don't you want to live with me?
- You decided to move in...

4
00:00:09,704 --> 00:00:13,644
(Penny:)...without even asking me if I was ready.
- I think we should talk about that.

5
00:00:14,442 --> 00:00:16,002
(Penny:)Since you love the truth so much...

6
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:19,540
...why not tell Amy you don't wanna
live with her instead of blaming me?

7
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:22,010
(Sheldon:)I thought we were talking about
the other thing.

8
00:00:23,518 --> 00:00:27,478
- You're a coward.
- Well, the evidence does support that.

9
00:00:29,957 --> 00:00:33,987
(Penny:)Come on, Amy. Let's go drink wine and talk
about what jerks our boyfriends are.

10
00:00:34,195 --> 00:00:37,685
(Amy:)You know what would show them?
I should move in here with you.

11
00:00:41,702 --> 00:00:43,572
(Leonard:)Um...

12
00:00:53,347 --> 00:00:56,547
So you wanna catch up
on some Walking Dead?

13
00:00:57,552 --> 00:00:58,572
(Sheldon:)Okay.

14
00:01:00,388 --> 00:01:02,378
(Sheldon:)Have you seen the one where Lori dies?

15
00:01:07,728 --> 00:01:09,218
(Leonard:)No.

16
00:01:10,898 --> 00:01:13,658
(Sheldon:)Or maybe she doesn't, let's find out.

17
00:01:27,615 --> 00:01:30,775
- Where are you going?
- No!

